"I LOVE THIS CLUMP OF WEEDS"

634
00:46:43,640 --> 00:46:46,560
<i>Okay, let's warm up</i>
<i>with a few quick-fire questions.</i>

635
00:46:46,640 --> 00:46:47,480
<i>Age?</i>

636
00:46:47,560 --> 00:46:48,400
<i>Sixteen.</i>

637
00:46:48,480 --> 00:46:49,640
<i>Favorite color?</i>

638
00:46:50,800 --> 00:46:51,880
<i>It's hard to decide.</i>

639
00:46:52,480 --> 00:46:53,840
<i>Favorite place?</i>

640
00:46:54,640 --> 00:46:56,320
<i>Grassy places with many flowers.</i>

641
00:46:56,400 --> 00:46:59,160
<i>- Favorite dish?</i>
<i>- Scrambled eggs with tomatoes.</i>

642
00:46:59,240 --> 00:47:00,600
<i>Favorite person?</i>

643
00:47:01,200 --> 00:47:02,800
<i>My family.</i>

644
00:47:02,880 --> 00:47:05,280
<i>What is the one thing you want to do most?</i>

645
00:47:06,680 --> 00:47:09,000
<i>- Let's move on to the next segment.</i>
<i>- Okay.</i>

646
00:47:09,080 --> 00:47:11,360
<i>Let's move on to the main agenda.</i>

647
00:47:11,440 --> 00:47:13,720
<i>First, I'm dying to know this.</i>

648
00:47:13,800 --> 00:47:16,720
<i>You've accomplished being published in</i>
<i>international journals in your teens.</i>

649
00:47:16,800 --> 00:47:18,040
<i>Is it because of passion?</i>

650
00:47:18,120 --> 00:47:19,280
<i>Passion?</i>

651
00:47:20,560 --> 00:47:22,960
<i>I think I'm far from that level.</i>

652
00:47:24,880 --> 00:47:27,080
<i>I guess it's fondness.</i>

653
00:47:27,160 --> 00:47:29,240
<i>I'm not intentionally or eagerly striving</i>

654
00:47:29,320 --> 00:47:31,840
<i>to achieve a particular outcome or result.</i>

655
00:47:31,920 --> 00:47:34,280
<i>Many things happen without you realizing</i>

656
00:47:34,360 --> 00:47:36,120
<i>in the process of liking something.</i>

657
00:47:36,200 --> 00:47:38,160
<i>For example, I learned calligraphy.</i>

658
00:47:38,240 --> 00:47:40,440
<i>Many asked me why I chose the Zhao style.</i>

659
00:47:40,520 --> 00:47:42,680
<i>I actually didn't</i>
<i>think about it that much.</i>

660
00:47:42,760 --> 00:47:44,480
<i>It just looked nice to me,</i>

661
00:47:44,560 --> 00:47:45,960
<i>so I practiced for a while.</i>

662
00:47:46,040 --> 00:47:47,200
<i>It happened to suit me.</i>

663
00:47:48,000 --> 00:47:49,120
<i>If you say that,</i>

664
00:47:49,200 --> 00:47:50,760
<i>many people will be envious.</i>

665
00:47:50,840 --> 00:47:52,120
<i>I already am.</i>

666
00:47:52,200 --> 00:47:53,600
<i>That's such an exaggeration.</i>

667
00:47:53,680 --> 00:47:55,520
<i>Your parents must love you dearly.</i>

668
00:47:55,600 --> 00:47:56,840
<i>Of course.</i>

669
00:47:56,920 --> 00:47:58,040
<i>Especially Ms. Zhou.</i>

670
00:47:58,120 --> 00:47:58,960
<i>Ms. Zhou?</i>

671
00:48:00,160 --> 00:48:02,560
<i>I'm used to calling my mother Ms. Zhou.</i>

672
00:48:02,640 --> 00:48:05,440
<i>She's a very outstanding</i>
<i>environmental engineer.</i>

673
00:48:06,160 --> 00:48:07,360
<i>I have received</i>

674
00:48:07,440 --> 00:48:10,080
<i>a lot of support and love from her.</i>

675
00:48:10,160 --> 00:48:12,960
<i>Ms. Zhou sounds like a very…</i>

676
00:48:18,120 --> 00:48:20,120
<i>Hello. You must be Yanzhou.</i>

677
00:48:20,200 --> 00:48:22,320
<i>We had heard that Guanqi has a brother.</i>

678
00:48:22,400 --> 00:48:23,880
<i>Can you chat with us?</i>

679
00:48:23,960 --> 00:48:24,840
<i>No.</i>

680
00:48:25,960 --> 00:48:27,120
<i>Sorry.</i>

681
00:48:28,400 --> 00:48:30,280
<i>My brother is rather quiet.</i>

682
00:48:30,360 --> 00:48:31,560
<i>Just point the camera at me.</i>

